		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03p17_swrival_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>となると　あとは……▼
よし！　[Name:TrainerName ]
オマエも　てつだえ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T09:57:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>となると　あとは……▼
よし！　[Name:TrainerName ]
オマエも　手伝え！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T12:23:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・表示後、下水道に入っていく
・続けてswchampion_02
・0＝主人公名</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T09:57:51" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWRIVAL
ライバル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T03:07:57" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03p17_swchampion_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アイリス『うん　いいんじゃない？▼
ヒウンげすいどう　なら
かくれる　ばしょに　ぴったり　かも！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T05:54:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アイリス『うん　いいんじゃない？▼
ヒウン下水道なら
隠れる　場所に　ぴったり　かも！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T05:54:37" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・d11r0101：下水道へ行くまで繰り返し</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T12:24:17" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWCHAMPION
アイリス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T03:07:42" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03p17_swchampion_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アイリス『きみの　ともだち……▼
なんだか　おこっていた　ようだけど
げすいどう　だいじょうぶ　だった？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T12:25:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T12:24:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アイリス『きみの　ともだち……▼
なんだか　怒っていた　ようだけど
下水道　大丈夫　だった？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T12:27:38" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T12:24:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・d11r0101でのイベント後
　自動で表示？</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T12:24:06" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWCHAMPION
アイリス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T12:24:06" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03p17_swchampion_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>で　これから　どうするの？▼
げすいどうで　ジムリーダーの
アーティと　あったんでしょ？▼
ポケモンジムに　いって
うでだめしを　するのも　いいかもね！▼
しょうぶ　することで　ポケモンも
トレーナーである　きみのこと▽
もっと　わかってくれるだろうし！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T12:27:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T12:24:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>で　これから　どうするの？▼
下水道で　ジムリーダーの
アーティと　会ったんでしょ？▼
ポケモンジムに　行って
腕試しを　するのも　いいかもね！▼
勝負することで　ポケモンも
トレーナーである　きみのこと▽
もっと　わかってくれるだろうし！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T12:27:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T12:24:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・以降、繰り返し
・c03ジムバッジ取得で削除</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T12:24:06" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWCHAMPION
アイリス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T12:24:06" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
