	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03p17_stop_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なんか　げすいどう　から
ひとのこえが　きこえるような……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T10:21:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>なんか　下水道から
人の声が　きこえるような……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T10:21:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・下水道ストッパー
・c03p07イベントまで
　画面右を向いたままで
　？マークを表示してからメッセージ表示</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T10:17:06" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>WORKMAN</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03p17_stop_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>はい？
げすいどうに　はいるんですか？▼
はあ……　それなら　やせいポケモンに
ちゅうい　してくださいよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T10:24:31" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>はい？
下水道に　入るんですか？▼
はあ……　それなら　野生ポケモンに
注意して　くださいよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T10:24:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・下水道ストッパー
・c03p07イベント後から</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>WORKMAN</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03p17_stop_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ヒウンげすいどうは　ですね
しおの　みちひきの　かんけいで▽
いける　ばしょが　かわるんですよね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T10:24:38" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ヒウン下水道は　ですね
干満の　関係で▽
行ける　場所が　変わるんですよね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T10:24:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・下水道ストッパー
・d11r0101でのイベント後から</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T10:25:04" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>WORKMAN</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
