			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03p17_badman_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おやゆびを　うえに　むけ
それいがいの　ゆびを　にぎりしめる▼
それが　サムズアップの　ポーズ
オーケーや　グッドって　ことさ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>親指を　上に　向け
それ以外の　指を　握り締める▼
それが　サムズアップの　ポーズ
オーケーや　グッドって　ことさ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BADMAN</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
